      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those feelings of inadequacy are incredibly painful, but they are distorting the truth of your worth. Your presence matters, even when you feel like you're failing, and that feeling of being a burden is a symptom of your pain, not a factual assessment of your value. A good therapist won't just tell you things are fine; they can help you understand *why* you feel this way and work with you to change those destructive thought patterns. Please allow someone professional to help you see past this overwhelming self-criticism.",
      "source": "target",
