      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that disappearing would bring relief is a very common, yet deeply misguided, thought when you are in this much pain. It is a feeling of wanting to stop the suffering, but that suffering is not exclusively yours to manage or solve. There are ways to stop the chaos without ending your own existence; instead of disappearing, you could find ways to manage the internal weight you are carrying. Please, reach out to a crisis line or a mental health professional right now to talk about these intense feelings.",
